      "title": "D and E",
      "body": "After C, the letters go forward as you move right. **D** sits between the two black keys of the pair, and **E** is just to the right of the pair.\n\n**Why it matters:** C, D and E always sit together around a group of two black keys, so you can find all three anywhere on the keyboard.",
